{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "marrakesh-bahia-ring-rosette",
  "title": "Ringed rosette of the Bahia Palace (Marrakesh)",
  "short": "Bahia Palace ringed rosette",
  "subtitle": "Bahia Palace, Marrakesh",
  "given": {
    "O": "The centre of the small star inside the large rosette.",
    "A": "A point of that small star."
  },
  "fold": 4,
  "star": 8,
  "style": "Moroccan",
  "level": "advanced",
  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "The finished design was read from Wichmann’s C123 drawing. Its tile corners were snapped to the square-root-of-two grid in small-star-radius units. The unit-star opening is shared with the other Moroccan reconstructions. After it every line, the tile’s sides too, is drawn through a crossing of earlier lines and turned round O. The drawing gives no steps; we devised the construction.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. The tile edges follow the plain drawing. The original is uncoloured; the colours follow Wichmann’s drawing in the Tétouan palette, whose dark navy stands for his black and whose red for his dark red. No photograph was checked.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-26"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data152/C123: Bahia Palace, Marrakesh",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "kind": "drawing",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data152/C123.html",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His reference is Jean-Marc Castéra, Arabesques: Decorative Art in Morocco (1999), page 123, the Bahia Palace, Marrakesh (19th century; no colouring in the original)."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal straight line through O and A. Draw a circle with centre O through A.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. It crosses the circle at C and D. The horizontal line crosses the circle at B on the left. Draw a vertical line through A. Draw a horizontal line through C. They cross at E. Draw a straight line through O and E. Draw a line through O at 90° to line OE. The circle crosses the four lines through O at S1 to S8.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "B": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "C": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "D": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "ax": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "cy": {"line": {"through": "C", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "E": {"point": {"meet": ["ax", "cy"]}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": ["O", "E"]}},
        "d135": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "S1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "S2": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "S3": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "S4": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d135"], "pick": {"angle": 135.0}}},
        "S5": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "S6": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 225.0}}},
        "S7": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "S8": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d135"], "pick": {"angle": 315.0}}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Draw the star at O as two squares.",
      "animate": "ruler",
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S1 and S3, S3 and S5, S5 and S7, and S7 and S1. Draw each line long, beyond the circle.",
          "create": {
            "q01": {"line": {"through": ["S1", "S3"]}},
            "q02": {"line": {"through": ["S3", "S5"]}},
            "q03": {"line": {"through": ["S5", "S7"]}},
            "q04": {"line": {"through": ["S7", "S1"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        },
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S2 and S4, S4 and S6, S6 and S8, and S8 and S2. Draw each line long, beyond the circle.",
          "create": {
            "q11": {"line": {"through": ["S2", "S4"]}},
            "q12": {"line": {"through": ["S4", "S6"]}},
            "q13": {"line": {"through": ["S6", "S8"]}},
            "q14": {"line": {"through": ["S8", "S2"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The horizontal line through C crosses the line from S5 to S7 at P1. Draw a line through P1 parallel to line OE. Turn it round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "P1": {"point": {"meet": ["cy", "q03"]}},
        "m1": {"line": {"through": "P1", "parallelTo": "d45"}},
        "mr1": {"repeat": {"of": ["m1"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The line through P1 parallel to line OE crosses its copy turned by 225° at P2. Draw a horizontal line through P2. Turn it round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "P2": {"point": {"meet": ["m1", "m1@5"]}},
        "m2": {"line": {"through": "P2", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "mr2": {"repeat": {"of": ["m2"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The line from S3 to S5 crosses the horizontal line through P2 at P3. The line from S2 to S4 crosses the horizontal line through P2, turned by 315°, at P4. Draw a vertical line through P3. Draw a vertical line through P4. Turn the new lines round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "P3": {"point": {"meet": ["q02", "m2"]}},
        "P4": {"point": {"meet": ["q11", "m2@7"]}},
        "m3": {"line": {"through": "P3", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "m4": {"line": {"through": "P4", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "mr4": {"repeat": {"of": ["m3", "m4"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "The vertical line through P4 crosses the vertical line through P4, turned by 45°, at P5. The line from S7 to S1 crosses the vertical line through P4 at P6. The line from S3 to S5 crosses the vertical line through P4 at P7. Draw a horizontal line through P5. Draw a horizontal line through P6. Draw a horizontal line through P7. Turn the new lines round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "P5": {"point": {"meet": ["m4", "m4@1"]}},
        "P6": {"point": {"meet": ["q04", "m4"]}},
        "P7": {"point": {"meet": ["q02", "m4"]}},
        "m5": {"line": {"through": "P5", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "m6": {"line": {"through": "P6", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "m7": {"line": {"through": "P7", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "mr7": {"repeat": {"of": ["m5", "m6", "m7"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The horizontal line through P2 crosses the horizontal line through P5, turned by 225°, at P8. The horizontal line through P2 crosses the vertical line through P3, turned by 315°, at P9. Draw a vertical line through P8. Draw a vertical line through P9. Turn the new lines round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "P8": {"point": {"meet": ["m2", "m5@5"]}},
        "P9": {"point": {"meet": ["m2", "m3@7"]}},
        "m8": {"line": {"through": "P8", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "m9": {"line": {"through": "P9", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "mr9": {"repeat": {"of": ["m8", "m9"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "The horizontal line through P2 crosses the horizontal line through P2, turned by 225°, at P10. The horizontal line through P2, turned by 45°, crosses the vertical line through P4 at P11. The horizontal line through P2, turned by 225°, crosses the horizontal line through P7 at P12. Draw a line through P10 at 90° to line OE. Draw a line through P11 at 90° to line OE. Draw a line through P12 at 90° to line OE. Turn the new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "P10": {"point": {"meet": ["m2", "m2@5"]}},
        "P11": {"point": {"meet": ["m2@1", "m4"]}},
        "P12": {"point": {"meet": ["m2@5", "m7"]}},
        "m10": {"line": {"through": "P10", "parallelTo": "d135"}},
        "m11": {"line": {"through": "P11", "parallelTo": "d135"}},
        "m12": {"line": {"through": "P12", "parallelTo": "d135"}},
        "mr12": {"repeat": {"of": ["m10", "m11", "m12"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "The horizontal line through C crosses the horizontal line through P7, turned by 225°, at T. Draw a vertical line through T. Turn it round O by 90°, three times. The four lines make a square with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4.",
      "create": {
        "T": {"point": {"meet": ["cy", "m7@5"]}},
        "gs": {"line": {"through": "T", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "gsr": {"repeat": {"of": ["gs"], "by": "rot4"}},
        "K1": {"point": {"meet": ["gs", "gs@1"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gs@1", "gs@2"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gs@2", "gs@3"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gs@3", "gs"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Join K1, K2, K3 and K4 to mark the tile that repeats.",
      "create": {"tile": {"polygon": ["K1", "K2", "K3", "K4"]}},
      "animate": "fade"
    }
  ],
